{"id":488,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"相模原メソッドで思考力と表現力を育む","feature_description":"神奈川県立相模原中等教育学校は、主体的な学びを支える「相模原メソッド」を実践しています。読書・暗唱・ドリル等で基礎を学び、発表やレポート、探究・ディベートへと段階的に進みます。知識を活用して課題を解決する力と、科学・論理的思考力、表現コミュニケーション力、社会生活実践力を育てます。前期課程では古典の暗唱、発表・討論や実験・観察を取り入れ、知識の定着だけでなく、考えを組み立てて伝える力も養います。","clubs":[{"id":9711,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9712,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9713,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9714,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9715,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9716,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9717,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9718,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9719,"name":"野球部〖前期課程は軟式、後期課程は硬式〗","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9720,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.pen-kanagawa.ed.jp/sagamihara-chuto-ss/seikatsu/bukatu.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9721,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"ht